note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/gdn_admit.om: the Omega port of CUDApp tests/gdn_admit_diff.c. Composed after gpu/nvidia/om/gdn/admit.om
note and gpu/nvidia/checks/lib.om; run with gpu/nvidia/checks/gdn_admit.tsv, whose expected values the retained C
note admission oracle (src/omega_gpu_gdn_admit.c, CUDAPP_MIGRATION_PENDING_C_GDN_ADMIT) wrote over the domain of the
note old differential (each predicate at v-1/v/v+1, 0 and the extremes of every field, the non-finite f32 classes,
note every alignment residue class).
note Case: OP A B C I0..I6 R O0..O9. o[0..6] = I0..I6, then gdn_admit OP A B C o must refuse (1) exactly when R is 1;
note when admitted, the outputs the C binding reads back must equal O: shape and alloc o[0..9], layout o[0..6], move
note o[0]. The other ops return a verdict only.
text t_name "GDN_ADMIT"
fn cname to void
for i ulong len t_name bound 64
ckoc ulong get t_name i
end
end
note how many outputs of gdn_admit OP the C binding reads
fn gouts op ulong to ulong
if or eq op 1 eq op 2
ret 10
end
if eq op 7
ret 7
end
if eq op 8
ret 1
end
ret 0
end
fn crow to bool
if ne ckcnt 22
ckbad
end
o = new ulong 16 0
for j ulong 7
put o j cknum add 4 j
end
op = cknum 0
r = gdn_admit op cknum 1 cknum 2 cknum 3 o
if ne r cknum 11
ret false
end
if ne r 0
ret true
end
for j ulong gouts op bound 10
if ne get o j cknum add 12 j
ret false
end
end
ret true
end
